summary:
  The raw episode URL outlives the episode it belongs to.

history:
  The raw URL is deliberately retired together with its siblings when playback
  stops. Leaving it behind means a later action can act on the previous
  episode's address — the exact shape of bug the "retires with its siblings"
  invariant was written for.

target:
  package/contents/ui/main.qml

find:
    _podPlayingKey = "";
          _podPlayingUrl = "";
          _podPlayingRawUrl = "";

replace:
    _podPlayingKey = "";
          _podPlayingUrl = "";

expect:
  tests/test_invariants.py::test_the_raw_episode_url_retires_with_its_siblings
